22:52.670 --> 22:54.540
Let's go, Pikachu! Are you ready?

22:55.710 --> 22:57.390
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

22:59.600 --> 23:02.260
Look forward to Pocket Monsters XY&Z!

23:02.530 --> 23:04.340
Everyone, get Pokémon!

23:06.880 --> 23:16.850
Next episode:

23:06.880 --> 23:11.830
Where has Squishy gone!?

23:07.690 --> 23:12.310
